                                "sense_id": "ca796056-df71-32ff-b7b9-909afc6ebb97",
                                "text": "He had a little wife, he ſaid, whom he loved, who did the patiſſerie; and added, he felt no diſhonour in defending her and himſelf from want in this way—unleſs Providence had offer’d him a better."
                            }
